      <item>
        <title>luna is a great and low-cost model</title>
        <dc:creator>@gdb</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>luna is a great and low-cost model</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Simon Willison (@simonw)</b>
<p>
<p>OK, GPT-5.6 Luna is a bit of a beast. Given the 80% price drop today I decided to try it in Datasette Agent, and it's furiously quick and generates all the SQL, HTML and JavaScript (for Datasette Apps) I could possibly want</p>

</p>
