      <item>
        <title>jevon&apos;s paradox at work</title>
        <dc:creator>@gdb</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>jevon's paradox at work</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Greg Kamradt (@GregKamradt)</b>
<p>
<p>I had a gnarly research project I needed done - 78K different classifications<br>
<br>
I let GPT-5.6 Luna run over night, batch mode ($.10/M input!)<br>
<br>
158K requests, 143M input tokens ended up being $60<br>
<br>
You don't have enough tokens working for you</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/GregKamradt/status/2083228765594018157#m">https://nitter.net/GregKamradt/status/2083228765594018157#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
