      <item>
        <title>GPT-5.6 Sol for resolving 100+ year old conjectures. Wild that this level of intelligence can be accessed by and is available to empower everyone!</title>
        <dc:creator>@gdb</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>GPT-5.6 Sol for resolving 100+ year old conjectures.<br>
<br>
Wild that this level of intelligence can be accessed by and is available to empower everyone!</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Philip Arathoon (@philarathoon)</b>
<p>
<p>The Maxwell conjecture is false. Counterexample found by AI (GPT-5.6 Sol), communicated by human mathematicians: <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197">arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2081975493914677248%2F8urMt3Y9%3Fformat%3Djpg%26name%3D420x420_2" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>The Maxwell Conjecture is False</b>
</a>
<p>We exhibit a configuration of five point charges in Euclidean space whose electrostatic potential admits at least 24 critical points all of which are non-degenerate. Maxwell&apos;s conjecture that the...</p>
<small><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27197">arxiv.org</a></small>


</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/philarathoon/status/2082831490560262624#m">https://nitter.net/philarathoon/status/2082831490560262624#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 04:35:52 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2083048981370921226</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/gdb/status/2083048981370921226#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>GPT-5.6 series has best price/performance</title>
        <dc:creator>@gdb</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>GPT-5.6 series has best price/performance</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Cognition (@cognition)</b>
<p>
<p>We've updated FrontierCode 1.1 to reflect new discounts for GPT-5.6 Terra and GPT-5.6 Luna. With these new costs, the GPT-5.6 series sits on the pareto curve of price/performance efficiency.</p>
<a href="https://nitter.net/cognition/status/2082913381678194927#m">
