      <item>
        <title>luna is a thing of beauty, incredibly capable and low-cost</title>
        <dc:creator>@gdb</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>luna is a thing of beauty, incredibly capable and low-cost</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Shashank Goyal (@shashankgoyal95)</b>
<p>
<p>Luna is far and ahead the most efficient dollar per token model right now.<br>
<br>
We also have an additional 50% off on top of the 80% at OpenRouter!</p>
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHOfqo7ZW8AAKgpp.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />


</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/shashankgoyal95/status/2082891485922423285#m">https://nitter.net/shashankgoyal95/status/2082891485922423285#m</a>
</footer>
